| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| steady speed (last 10 strides), peak 1 s | 4.62-4.68, 4.72 m/s | 5.00, 5.06 m/s | |
| step rate, step length | 3.0-3.2 /s, 1.44-1.55 m | 2.8 /s, 1.78 m | ~3.0 /s, ~1.7 m |
