| pinch: thumb and index thresholds 0.15 shorter, the other fingers 0.15 longer (`gp_th`, `gp_ix`, `gp_rest`) | 0 | 301 (paddle lost) | 74 |
| wrist-extension bias `bh_wflex` 0.30 -> 0.10 | **21** | **137** | 21 |
