| forehand, live tracking | -0.47 | -0.20 | -0.30 | -0.07 | +0.29 | +0.04 | 0.00 | -0.03 | 0.32 |
| backhand, champion | -1.52 | +0.32 | +0.87 | +0.02 | +0.50 | -0.02 | -0.04 | +0.21 | 0.80 |
